# SP 800-185 on backends::xkcp: cSHAKE, TupleHash and ParallelHash through
# digest_of and hasher, KMAC through mac, against NIST's samples and values
# of an implementation independent of XKCP; their options and guards. Then
# the guards of SP 800-185's lengths in bits, the limit lowered to 16 bytes
# through the seam WEBCPP_HASH_DETAIL_TEST_SP800_185_MAX_BYTES.
