# The families of spec 2.15, digest_of, hasher, mac and argon2: their guards
# and failures on the mock backend (support/mock_backend.hpp); Boost.Hash2's
# digests and HMACs on backends::hash2, keccak_256 on backends::xkcp and
# BLAKE3's extendable output on backends::blake3 against the Hash2-form types;
